        "Id": 114,
        "ActionId": 114,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Haicma",
            "That is just your one-sided perspective. Miracles are merely after-the-fact conclusions.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 115,
        "ActionId": 115,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "But miracles exist. The conservation area is one of them, and so is this encounter.",
            116
